OL,3,GNEWSAHow plans to merge councils cost
OL,4,Amillions
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical leaders say stalled attempts
OL,7,Fto merge councils were "chaotic" and a
OL,8,F"charade" which cost millions of pounds
OL,9,Fof taxpayers' money.
OL,11,FAngela Rayner, local government
OL,12,Fsecretary, announced on Monday a pause
OL,13,Fin the process after receiving legal
OL,14,Fadvice.
OL,16,FThe merger would have seen some
OL,17,Ftwo-tier county, district and borough
OL,18,Fcouncils scrapped in favour of one-tier
OL,19,Funitary councils.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
